{"memory_id": "MEM_20260510_0005", "memory_type": "watch_memory", "status": "active", "title": "Suspension from Assembly for 30 days (February 2025)", "summary": "Suspension from Assembly for 30 days (February 2025)", "memory_scope": ["region", "cross_domain", "company"], "time_horizon": "short_term", "linked_entities": ["Suvendu Adhikari", "West Bengal Legislative Assembly"], "linked_themes": [], "linked_events": ["EVT_20260510_0176"], "linked_facts": [], "linked_claims": [], "source_refs": [{"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00056", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00056_C02", "supporting_text": "One such suspension in February 2025 barred him from attending Assembly proceedings for 30 consecutive days.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T19:28:05+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00054", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00054_C01", "supporting_text": "One of the most notable episodes came in February 2025, when Adhikari was suspended from the Assembly for 30 days following a heated confrontation.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T20:28:55+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00047", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00047_C01", "supporting_text": "As per established protocol, the previous chief minister\u2019s designated furniture and official markers were removed. Necessary modifications are being carried out for the new administration.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T22:19:48+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00042", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00042_C01", "supporting_text": "Adhikari was sworn in as the 9th Chief Minister of West Bengal by Governor RN Ravi at a grand ceremony in Kolkata attended by Prime Minister Modi, Union Home Minister Amit Shah and several senior BJP leaders.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T23:21:26+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00052", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00052_C01", "supporting_text": "Retired Indian Administrative Service (IAS) officer Subrata Gupta was on Saturday appointed as adviser to West Bengal Chief Minister Suvendu Adhikari, according to an official order issued by the state government.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T21:30:01+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00089", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00089_C01", "supporting_text": "Leader of West Bengal BJP Legislative Assembly Suvendu Adhikari has been sworn-in as Bharatiya Janata Party's (BJP) first CM in the state since Independence.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T07:05:00+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00082", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00082_C01", "supporting_text": "\"A historic dawn for West Bengal indeed. It is a moment of profound pride and jubilation to welcome Visionary Leader Hon'ble PM Shri @narendramodi Ji to the City of Joy. Today, as we witness the Swearing-in-Ceremony of the first-ever BJP Government in West Bengal since Independence, we fulfill the dreams of our founding fathers.\"", "published_at": "2026-05-09T11:32:23+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00085", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00085_C01", "supporting_text": "A BJP government, headed by Suvendu Adhikari, is going to take oath for the first time in West Bengal on Saturday. PM Modi is expected to attend it.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T10:38:19+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00088", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00088_C01", "supporting_text": "-\u2018Giant killer\u2019 image Suvendu Adhikari\u2019s rise in the BJP was shaped largely by his direct political confrontations with Mamata Banerjee. Party supporters describe him as a \u201cgiant killer\u201d for challenging her in politically sensitive strongholds.", "published_at": "2026-05-09T09:18:16+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}], "why_stored": "regulatory_action with medium severity", "future_use_cases": ["company deep dive", "thesis monitoring", "risk tracking"], "recurrence": {"occurrence_count": 46, "source_diversity_count": 1}, "retention": {"retention_days": 90, "expires_at": "2026-08-08", "decay_policy": "medium_decay"}, "created_at": "2026-05-10T10:24:54.288907+05:30", "updated_at": "2026-05-10T10:36:04.625201+05:30", "last_seen_at": "2026-05-10T10:36:04.625201+05:30", "confidence": 0.894, "source_object_type": "event", "source_object_id": "EVT_20260510_0176", "research_run_id": "RUN_2026_05_10_LAYER4"}
